abstract: >-
  A frozen 18-cell Q2 2026 filing cross-section for CoreWeave, Nebius and Astera
  Labs, accompanied by three accession-level source ledgers, cell-level
  comparability tiers, SEC acceptance clocks, schemas and deterministic checks.
